an></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(2)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:24.34pt">Expected life after factoring likely early exercise.</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(3)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:24.34pt">Fair value estimated at June 30, 2023 as the valuation date under AASB2 has not been met as of June 30, 2023.</span></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The closing share market price of an ordinary share of Mesoblast Limited on the ASX as of June&#160;30, 2023 was A$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="audPerShare" contextRef="c-3" decimals="2" name="meso:ClosingShareMarketPriceOfOrdinaryShare" scale="0" id="f-2640">1.14</ix:nonFraction>.</span></div><ix:continuation id="f-2567-1" continuedAt="f-2567-2"><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The model inputs for the valuations of options approved and granted during the year ended June&#160;30, 2022 are as follows:</span></div><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:21.475%"></td><td style="wid